      "organization_id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "content": "# Acme Corporation Operations & IT Policy 2026\n\n## Section 1: Work Hours and Core Schedules\n- Standard working hours are 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM EST, Monday through Friday.\n- Core collaboration hours are 10:00 AM to 3:00 PM EST, during which all team members must be reachable via Slack.\n- Flexible remote work is permitted up to 3 days per week with manager approval.\n\n## Section 2: IT Equipment and Reimbursement\n- Every new full-time employee is provisioned a MacBook Pro (16-inch, M3 Pro) or a ThinkPad P1 Gen 6.\n- The company provides a one-time home office setup stipend of $1,200.\n- Monthly broadband internet reimbursement is capped at $75 per month. Submit receipts by the 25th of each month through Expensify.\n\n## Section 3: IT Security and WiFi Credentials\n- Corporate Office Network SSID: \"Acme-Secure-Corp\"\n- Guest Network SSID: \"Acme-Visitors\"\n- VPN Gateway URL: vpn.acme-corp.internal:8443\n- Passwords must be at least 16 characters long, contain at least one special character, and be rotated every 90 days.\n- In case of a suspected security breach, contact the InfoSec Incident Response Team immediately at security-ops@acme-corp.internal or dial extension #4409.\n\n## Section 4: Project Code Names\n- Project Falcon: Autonomous analytics pipeline scheduled for Q3 deployment.\n- Project Titan: Global multi-cloud data migration effort.",
