      "content": "# Acme Corporation Engineering Runbook & Incident Protocols\n\n## Section 1: Deployment & Staging Pipelines\n- Automated staging builds trigger via GitHub Actions on every pull request to the `develop` branch.\n- Production deployments occur exclusively on Tuesdays and Thursdays at 10:00 AM EST following QA sign-off.\n- The emergency deployment rollback command is `make deploy-rollback-immediate`.\n\n## Section 2: Database Failover & Replication\n- The primary PostgreSQL read-write replica runs in region us-east-1.\n- Secondary warm-standby read instances are maintained in us-west-2 and eu-west-1.\n- Database automatic promotion threshold: failover initiates if health-check heartbeats drop for 45 consecutive seconds.\n- Primary database connection pool size is capped at 120 active connections per worker instance.\n\n## Section 3: Internal Monitoring & Observability\n- Datadog dashboard cluster tag: `acme-prod-telemetry-01`.\n- Sentry DSN project identifier: `org-error-tracker-8831`.\n- On-call escalation schedule rotations update weekly on Mondays at 00:00 UTC.",
